 75BR c  Compiled (unevaluated) dataset from 2009Mu16:                          
 75BR2c  Nucl Phys A: Mukherjee et al., corrected proofs version;               
 75BR3c  available online August 25, 2009.                                      
 75BR c  Compiled by A. MacDonald and B. Singh (McMaster); September 3, 2009.   
 75BR c  {+28}Si beam produced at E=115 MeV by the 15UD Pelletron at the Inter  
 75BR2c  University Accelerator Centre in New Delhi. |g's were detected using   
 75BR3c  the Gamma Detector Array (GDA), consisting of 12 HPGe detectors with a 
 75BR4c  14 element BGO multiplicity filter. Measured E|g, I|g, |g|g-           
 75BR5c  coincidence, lifetimes using the Doppler shift attenuation method.     
 75BR6c  Comparisons with cranking model calculations                           
